        "\n",
        "From structured Part 1 JSON to backlog text (Epic to Sub-Epic to User Story to Task).\n",
        "\n",
        "This notebook expects an existing model2_part1_to_backlog.jsonl dataset in llms/fine_tune/dataset."
      ]
